<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>deeptfolio — Calculadora FIRE</title>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Playfair+Display:ital,wght@0,400;0,500;0,600;0,700;1,400;1,500&family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        :root {
            --burgundy-deep: #3D0F14;
            --burgundy-dark: #5C1A20;
            --burgundy: #7B2D35;
            --burgundy-mid: #8B3A42;
            --burgundy-light: #A84B52;
            --burgundy-pale: #C46B73;
            --gold: #C9A84C;
            --gold-light: #D4B96A;
            --gold-pale: #E8D5A0;
            --cream: #F5EDE4;
            --cream-light: #FAF6F2;
            --text-dark: #1A080A;
            --text-muted: #6B5055;
            --bg-dark: #1A0A0E;
            --bg-card: #2A1015;
            --bg-card-light: #35151A;
            --white: #FFFFFF;
            --success: #4A9E6E;
            --danger: #C45A5A;
            --info: #5B8DB8;
        }

        * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
        html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }

        body {
            font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
            background: var(--bg-dark);
            color: var(--cream);
            overflow-x: hidden;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        ::-webkit-scrollbar { width: 8px; }
        ::-webkit-scrollbar-track { background: var(--bg-dark); }
        ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb { background: var(--burgundy); border-radius: 4px; }

        /* NAVBAR */
        .navbar {
            position: fixed; top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; z-index: 1000;
            padding: 1rem 2rem; display: flex; align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between; transition: all 0.4s;
            background: transparent;
        }
        .navbar.scrolled {
            background: rgba(26, 10, 14, 0.95);
            backdrop-filter: blur(20px);
            border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(123, 45, 53, 0.3);
            padding: 0.7rem 2rem;
        }
        .nav-logo { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem; text-decoration: none; }
        .nav-logo-icon {
            width: 40px; height: 40px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--burgundy), var(--gold));
            border-radius: 10px; display: flex; align-items: center;
            justify-content: center; font-size: 1.2rem; font-weight: 700;
            color: var(--white); font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
        }
        .nav-logo-text {
            font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif; font-size: 1.6rem;
            font-weight: 600; color: var(--cream); letter-spacing: -0.5px;
        }
        .nav-logo-text span { color: var(--gold); }
        .nav-links { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 2rem; list-style: none; }
        .nav-links a {
            text-decoration: none; color: var(--cream); font-size: 0.9rem;
            font-weight: 400; opacity: 0.8; transition: all 0.3s; position: relative;
        }
        .nav-links a:hover { opacity: 1; color: var(--gold); }
        .btn {
            display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
            padding: 0.7rem 1.5rem; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 0.9rem;
            font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer;
            transition: all 0.3s; border: none; font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
        }
        .btn-ghost {
            background: transparent; color: var(--cream);
            border: 1px solid rgba(201, 168, 76, 0.3);
        }
        .btn-ghost:hover { border-color: var(--gold); color: var(--gold); }
        .btn-primary {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--burgundy), var(--burgundy-mid));
            color: var(--white); box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(123, 45, 53, 0.4);
        }
        .btn-primary:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); box-shadow: 0 8px 25px rgba(123, 45, 53, 0.5); }
        .btn-gold {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--gold), var(--gold-light));
            color: var(--text-dark); font-weight: 600;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(201, 168, 76, 0.3);
        }
        .btn-gold:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); box-shadow: 0 8px 25px rgba(201, 168, 76, 0.4); }
        .btn-large { padding: 1rem 2.2rem; font-size: 1rem; border-radius: 10px; }

        /* HERO */
        .hero {
            min-height: 60vh; display: flex; align-items: center;
            justify-content: center; position: relative;
            padding: 8rem 2rem 3rem; overflow: hidden;
        }
        .hero-bg {
            position: absolute; inset: 0; z-index: 0;
        }
        .hero-bg::before {
            content: ''; position: absolute; top: -50%; left: -50%;
            width: 200%; height: 200%;
            background: radial-gradient(ellipse at 30% 20%, rgba(123, 45, 53, 0.15) 0%, transparent 50%),
                        radial-gradient(ellipse at 70% 60%, rgba(201, 168, 76, 0.05) 0%, transparent 50%);
            animation: heroBgMove 20s ease-in-out infinite alternate;
        }
        @keyframes heroBgMove {
            0% { transform: translate(0, 0); }
            100% { transform: translate(-2%, -1%); }
        }
        .hero-content { position: relative; z-index: 1; text-align: center; max-width: 800px; }
        .hero-badge {
            display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem;
            padding: 0.5rem 1.2rem; background: rgba(123, 45, 53, 0.2);
            border: 1px solid rgba(201, 168, 76, 0.2); border-radius: 50px;
            font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--gold-pale); margin-bottom: 2rem;
        }
        .hero-badge-dot {
            width: 8px; height: 8px; background: var(--gold);
            border-radius: 50%; animation: pulse 2s infinite;
        }
        @keyframes pulse {
            0%, 100% { opacity: 1; transform: scale(1); }
            50% { opacity: 0.5; transform: scale(1.5); }
        }
        .hero-title {
            font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
            font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 5vw, 3.8rem); font-weight: 700;
            line-height: 1.1; margin-bottom: 1rem;
        }
        .hero-title .highlight {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--gold), var(--gold-light), var(--gold-pale));
            -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent; background-clip: text;
        }
        .hero-title .italic { font-style: italic; color: var(--burgundy-pale); -webkit-text-fill-color: var(--burgundy-pale); }
        .hero-subtitle {
            font-size: clamp(0.95rem, 1.8vw, 1.15rem); color: var(--cream);
            opacity: 0.6; max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto;
            font-weight: 300; line-height: 1.7;
        }

        /* MAIN CALCULATOR */
        .calculator-section {
            padding: 2rem 2rem 6rem; position: relative;
        }
        .calc-container {
            max-width: 1300px; margin: 0 auto;
            display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 2rem;
        }

        /* PANELS */
        .panel {
            background: rgba(42, 16, 21, 0.7);
            border: 1px solid rgba(123, 45, 53, 0.25);
            border-radius: 20px; padding: 2rem;
            backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
            transition: all 0.3s;
        }
        .panel:hover { border-color: rgba(123, 45, 53, 0.4); }
        .panel-title {
            font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
            font-size: 1.3rem; font-weight: 600;
            margin-bottom: 0.3rem; display: flex;
            align-items: center; gap: 0.6rem;
        }
        .panel-subtitle {
            font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--cream); opacity: 0.4;
            margin-bottom: 1.8rem;
        }

        /* INPUT GROUPS */
        .input-group {
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
        }
        .input-label {
            display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between;
            margin-bottom: 0.6rem;
        }
        .input-label-text {
            font-size: 0.85rem; font-weight: 500; color: var(--cream); opacity: 0.8;
        }
        .input-label-text small {
            font-weight: 300; opacity: 0.5; margin-left: 0.3rem;
        }
        .input-value-display {
            font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
            font-size: 0.85rem; font-weight: 500;
            color: var(--gold); background: rgba(201, 168, 76, 0.08);
            padding: 0.2rem 0.6rem; border-radius: 6px;
            border: 1px solid rgba(201, 168, 76, 0.15);
        }

        /* CUSTOM RANGE SLIDER */
        .slider-container {
            position: relative; padding: 0.5rem 0;
        }
        input[type="range"] {
            -webkit-appearance: none; appearance: none;
            width: 100%; height: 6px;
            background: rgba(123, 45, 53, 0.3);
            border-radius: 3px; outline: none;
            cursor: pointer;
        }
        input[type="range"]::-webkit-slider-thumb {
            -webkit-appearance: none; appearance: none;
            width: 22px; height: 22px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--gold), var(--gold-light));
            border-radius: 50%; cursor: pointer;
            box-shadow: 0 2px 10px rgba(201, 168, 76, 0.4);
            transition: transform 0.2s;
        }
        input[type="range"]::-webkit-slider-thumb:hover {
            transform: scale(1.2);
        }
        input[type="range"]::-moz-range-thumb {
            width: 22px; height: 22px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--gold), var(--gold-light));
            border-radius: 50%; cursor: pointer; border: none;
            box-shadow: 0 2px 10px rgba(201, 168, 76, 0.4);
        }

        /* CUSTOM NUMBER INPUT */
        .number-input {
            width: 100%; padding: 0.7rem 1rem;
            background: rgba(26, 10, 14, 0.6);
            border: 1px solid rgba(123, 45, 53, 0.3);
            border-radius: 10px; color: var(--cream);
            font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
            font-size: 1rem; outline: none;
            transition: all 0.3s;
        }
        .number-input:focus {
            border-color: var(--gold);
            box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(201, 168, 76, 0.1);
        }

        /* FIRE TIERS */
        .fire-tiers {
            display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 0.75rem;
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
        }
        .fire-tier {
            padding: 1rem; border-radius: 12px;
            border: 1px solid rgba(123, 45, 53, 0.2);
            background: rgba(26, 10, 14, 0.4);
            cursor: pointer; transition: all 0.3s;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .fire-tier:hover { border-color: rgba(201, 168, 76, 0.3); }
        .fire-tier.active {
            border-color: var(--gold);
            background: rgba(201, 168, 76, 0.08);
            box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(201, 168, 76, 0.1);
        }
        .fire-tier-icon { font-size: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 0.3rem; }
        .fire-tier-name {
            font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
            font-size: 0.9rem; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 0.2rem;
        }
        .fire-tier-desc {
            font-size: 0.7rem; color: var(--cream); opacity: 0.4;
        }
        .fire-tier-amount {
            font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
            font-size: 0.8rem; color: var(--gold);
            margin-top: 0.4rem; font-weight: 500;
        }

        /* RESULTS */
        .results-panel {
            position: sticky; top: 80px;
        }
        .result-hero {
            text-align: center; padding: 2rem 1rem;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(123, 45, 53, 0.2), rgba(201, 168, 76, 0.05));
            border-radius: 16px; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
            border: 1px solid rgba(201, 168, 76, 0.15);
        }
        .result-hero-label {
            font-size: 0.8rem; text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 2px; color: var(--cream); opacity: 0.5;
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
        }
        .result-hero-value {
            font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
            font-size: 3rem; font-weight: 700;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--gold), var(--gold-light));
            -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
            background-clip: text;
        }
        .result-hero-sub {
            font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--cream); opacity: 0.6;
            margin-top: 0.3rem;
        }

        .result-grid {
            display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 0.75rem;
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
        }
        .result-card {
            padding: 1rem; border-radius: 12px;
            background: rgba(26, 10, 14, 0.5);
            border: 1px solid rgba(123, 45, 53, 0.15);
            text-align: center;
        }
        .result-card-value {
            font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
            font-size: 1.3rem; font-weight: 600;
            margin-bottom: 0.2rem;
        }
        .result-card-label {
            font-size: 0.75rem; color: var(--cream); opacity: 0.4;
            text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;
        }
        .result-card-value.gold { color: var(--gold); }
        .result-card-value.green { color: var(--success); }
        .result-card-value.red { color: var(--danger); }
        .result-card-value.blue { color: var(--info); }

        /* PROGRESS BAR */
        .fire-progress {
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
        }
        .fire-progress-header {
            display: flex; justify-content: space-between;
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
        }
        .fire-progress-label {
            font-size: 0.85rem; font-weight: 500;
        }
        .fire-progress-percent {
            font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
            font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--gold);
        }
        .fire-progress-bar {
            width: 100%; height: 12px;
            background: rgba(123, 45, 53, 0.2);
            border-radius: 6px; overflow: hidden;
        }
        .fire-progress-fill {
            height: 100%; border-radius: 6px;
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--burgundy), var(--gold));
            transition: width 0.8s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);
            position: relative;
        }
        .fire-progress-fill::after {
            content: ''; position: absolute;
            top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; bottom: 0;
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, rgba(255,255,255,0.1), transparent);
            animation: shimmer 2s infinite;
        }
        @keyframes shimmer {
            0% { transform: translateX(-100%); }
            100% { transform: translateX(100%); }
        }

        /* CHART */
        .chart-panel {
            grid-column: 1 / -1;
        }
        .chart-wrapper {
            position: relative; height: 350px;
        }
        .chart-wrapper canvas {
            width: 100%; height: 100%;
        }
        .chart-legend {
            display: flex; gap: 1.5rem; justify-content: center;
            margin-top: 1rem; flex-wrap: wrap;
        }
        .chart-legend-item {
            display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem;
            font-size: 0.8rem; color: var(--cream); opacity: 0.7;
        }
        .chart-legend-dot {
            width: 10px; height: 10px; border-radius: 3px;
        }

        /* YEARLY TABLE */
        .yearly-section {
            grid-column: 1 / -1;
        }
        .yearly-table-wrapper {
            max-height: 400px; overflow-y: auto;
            border-radius: 12px;
        }
        .yearly-table {
            width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
        }
        .yearly-table thead th {
            position: sticky; top: 0;
            padding: 0.8rem 1rem; text-align: right;
            font-size: 0.75rem; text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 1px; color: var(--cream); opacity: 0.5;
            font-weight: 500;
            background: rgba(42, 16, 21, 0.95);
            border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(123, 45, 53, 0.2);
        }
        .yearly-table thead th:first-child { text-align: left; }
        .yearly-table tbody td {
            padding: 0.6rem 1rem; text-align: right;
            font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
            font-size: 0.8rem;
            border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(123, 45, 53, 0.08);
        }
        .yearly-table tbody td:first-child {
            text-align: left;
            font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
            color: var(--cream); opacity: 0.6;
        }
        .yearly-table tbody tr.fire-year {
            background: rgba(201, 168, 76, 0.08);
        }
        .yearly-table tbody tr.fire-year td {
            color: var(--gold); font-weight: 500;
        }
        .yearly-table tbody tr:hover {
            background: rgba(123, 45, 53, 0.1);
        }
        .yearly-table .positive { color: var(--success); }
        .yearly-table .negative { color: var(--danger); }

        /* TIPS SECTION */
        .tips-section {
            grid-column: 1 / -1;
        }
        .tips-grid {
            display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 1rem;
        }
        .tip-card {
            padding: 1.5rem; border-radius: 12px;
            background: rgba(26, 10, 14, 0.5);
            border: 1px solid rgba(123, 45, 53, 0.15);
            transition: all 0.3s;
        }
        .tip-card:hover { border-color: rgba(201, 168, 76, 0.3); transform: translateY(-2px); }
        .tip-icon { font-size: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 0.8rem; }
        .tip-title {
            font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
            font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
        }
        .tip-text {
            font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--cream); opacity: 0.5; line-height: 1.6;
        }

        /* SCROLLBAR for table */
        .yearly-table-wrapper::-webkit-scrollbar { width: 6px; }
        .yearly-table-wrapper::-webkit-scrollbar-track { background: transparent; }
        .yearly-table-wrapper::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb { background: var(--burgundy); border-radius: 3px; }

        /* SECTION LABEL */
        .section-label {
            display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem;
            font-size: 0.8rem; text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 2px; color: var(--gold); font-weight: 500;
        }
        .section-label::before {
            content: ''; width: 30px; height: 1px; background: var(--gold);
        }

        /* FOOTER */
        .footer {
            background: rgba(26, 10, 14, 0.95);
            border-top: 1px solid rgba(123, 45, 53, 0.2);
            padding: 3rem 2rem 2rem; text-align: center;
        }
        .footer p {
            font-size: 0.8rem; color: var(--cream); opacity: 0.3;
        }

        /* RESPONSIVE */
        @media (max-width: 1024px) {
            .calc-container { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
            .results-panel { position: static; }
            .chart-panel, .yearly-section, .tips-section { grid-column: 1; }
            .tips-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
        }
        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .nav-links { display: none; }
            .fire-tiers { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
            .result-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
            .tips-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
            .hero-title { font-size: 2rem; }
            .result-hero-value { font-size: 2.2rem; }
        }
        @media (max-width: 480px) {
            .fire-tiers { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
            .result-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
        }

        /* ANIMATIONS */
        .reveal {
            opacity: 0; transform: translateY(30px);
            transition: all 0.8s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);
        }
        .reveal.visible { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }

        /* Tooltip */
        .info-tip {
            display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
            width: 16px; height: 16px; border-radius: 50%;
            background: rgba(123, 45, 53, 0.3); font-size: 0.6rem;
            cursor: help; position: relative; margin-left: 0.3rem;
            vertical-align: middle;
        }
        .info-tip:hover::after {
            content: attr(data-tip);
            position: absolute; bottom: 100%; left: 50%;
            transform: translateX(-50%); padding: 0.5rem 0.8rem;
            background: var(--bg-card-light); border: 1px solid rgba(123, 45, 53, 0.3);
            border-radius: 8px; font-size: 0.75rem; white-space: nowrap;
            color: var(--cream); opacity: 1; z-index: 10;
            font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; font-weight: 400;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
        }

        /* Divider */
        .divider {
            height: 1px; background: rgba(123, 45, 53, 0.2);
            margin: 1.5rem 0;
        }

        /* Milestone badges */
        .milestones {
            display: flex; gap: 0.5rem; flex-wrap: wrap;
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
        }
        .milestone {
            display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.4rem;
            padding: 0.4rem 0.8rem; border-radius: 8px;
            font-size: 0.75rem; font-weight: 500;
            border: 1px solid;
        }
        .milestone.achieved {
            background: rgba(74, 158, 110, 0.1);
            border-color: rgba(74, 158, 110, 0.3);
            color: var(--success);
        }
        .milestone.pending {
            background: rgba(123, 45, 53, 0.1);
            border-color: rgba(123, 45, 53, 0.2);
            color: var(--cream); opacity: 0.4;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <!-- NAVBAR -->
    <nav class="navbar" id="navbar">
        <a href="#" class="nav-logo">
            <div class="nav-logo-icon">d</div>
            <div class="nav-logo-text">deep<span>tfolio</span></div>
        </a>
        <ul class="nav-links">
            <li><a href="#calculator">Calculadora</a></li>
            <li><a href="#projection">Proyección</a></li>
            <li><a href="#details">Detalle Anual</a></li>
            <li><a href="#tips">Consejos</a></li>
        </ul>
        <a href="#" class="btn btn-primary">Empezar Gratis</a>
    </nav>

    <!-- HERO -->
    <section class="hero">
        <div class="hero-bg"></div>
        <div class="hero-content">
            <div class="hero-badge">
                <span class="hero-badge-dot"></span>
                Calculadora FIRE — Financial Independence, Retire Early
            </div>
            <h1 class="hero-title">
                Calcula tu camino hacia la<br>
                <span class="highlight">libertad financiera</span>
            </h1>
            <p class="hero-subtitle">
                Introduce tus datos y descubre cuánto necesitas ahorrar, cuándo podrás jubilarte 
                y cómo optimizar tu estrategia con la regla del 4% y análisis de inflación.
            </p>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- CALCULATOR -->
    <section class="calculator-section" id="calculator">
        <div class="calc-container">

            <!-- LEFT: INPUTS -->
            <div class="panel reveal">
                <div class="panel-title">📊 Tus Datos Financieros</div>
                <div class="panel-subtitle">Ajusta los parámetros para calcular tu camino al FIRE</div>

                <!-- FIRE Tier -->
                <div class="input-group">
                    <div class="input-label">
                        <span class="input-label-text">Tipo de FIRE <span class="info-tip" data-tip="Elige tu estilo de vida post-jubilación">?</span></span>
